25-03-15.22:40:48.601 [main            ] INFO  ApiTest                - queryLatestInfo:[{"cnDescribe":"Microsoft Windows Remote Desktop Services是美国微软（Microsoft）公司的一个允许用户远程访问图形桌面和Windows应用程序的功能集合。Microsoft Windows Remote Desktop Services存在远程代码执行漏洞，该漏洞是由远程桌面服务组件中的缺陷引起的。攻击者可利用此漏洞在系统上执行任意代码。","cnImpact":"Microsoft Windows Server 2016   ;   Microsoft Windows Server 2019   ;   Microsoft Windows Server 2022   ;   Microsoft Windows Server 2022 23H2 Edition (Server Core installation)   ;   Microsoft Windows Server 2025   ;   ","cnPatch":"Microsoft Windows Remote Desktop Services远程代码执行漏洞（CNVD-2025-01185）的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/651306","cnReference":"https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2024-49108","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2024-49108","cnTitle":"Microsoft Windows Remote Desktop Services远程代码执行漏洞（CNVD-2025-01185）","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-01185","cveId":"CVE-2024-49108","hazardLevel":"高","id":30252,"pubDate":"2025-01-17"},{"cnDescribe":"LightPicture是一个企业/团队/个人图片资源管理系统、图床系统。LightPicture存在跨站脚本漏洞，该漏洞源于文件/api/upload的参数file对用户提供的数据缺乏有效过滤与转义，攻击者可利用该漏洞通过注入精心设计的有效载荷执行任意Web脚本或HTML。","cnImpact":"LightPicture LightPicture <=1.2.2   ;   ","cnPatch":"Null","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-13141","cnSolution":"厂商尚未提供漏洞修复方案，请关注厂商主页更新：https://github.com/Hebing123/cve/issues/83","cnTitle":"LightPicture跨站脚本漏洞","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-01703","cveId":"CVE-2024-13141","hazardLevel":"中","id":30251,"pubDate":"2025-01-17"},{"cnDescribe":"Linux kernel是美国Linux基金会的开源操作系统Linux所使用的内核。Linux kernel存在安全漏洞，该漏洞源于MIPS架构Loongson64的DTS文件中PCIe端口节点的配置不正确，导致dtc警告和运行时警告出现，可能影响系统的稳定性和正确性。目前没有详细的漏洞细节提供。","cnImpact":"Linux Kernel   ;   ","cnPatch":"Linux kernel存在未明漏洞（CNVD-2025-01702）的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/651931","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-56785","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/01575f2ff8ba578a3436f230668bd056dc2eb823","cnTitle":"Linux kernel存在未明漏洞（CNVD-2025-01702）","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-01702","cveId":"CVE-2024-56785","hazardLevel":"中","id":30250,"pubDate":"2025-01-17"},{"cnDescribe":"Huawei HarmonyOS是中国华为（Huawei）公司的一个操作系统。提供一个基于微内核的全场景分布式操作系统。Huawei HarmonyOS存在安全漏洞，攻击者可利用该漏洞可能导致可用性受影响。","cnImpact":"Huawei HarmonyOS 5.0.0   ;   ","cnPatch":"Huawei HarmonyOS存在未明漏洞（CNVD-2025-01701）的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/652061","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-56446","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/bulletin/2025/1/","cnTitle":"Huawei HarmonyOS存在未明漏洞（CNVD-2025-01701）","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-01701","cveId":"CVE-2024-56446","hazardLevel":"高","id":30249,"pubDate":"2025-01-17"},{"cnDescribe":"Siveillance Video（以前称为Siveillance VMS）是一款功能强大的IP视频管理软件，专为从小型简单到大规模和高安全性的部署而设计。Siveillance Video系列产品组合包括四个版本：Siveillance Video Core、Core Plus、Advanced和Pro，可满足从中小型解决方案到大型复杂部署的特定需求。Siemens Siveillance Video摄像机驱动程序存在信息泄露漏洞，本地攻击者可利用漏洞在特定条件下读取存储在Recording Server中的摄像机凭据。","cnImpact":"Siemens Siveillance Video Device Pack <V13.5   ;   ","cnPatch":"Siemens Siveillance Video摄像机驱动程序信息泄露漏洞的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/651896","cnReference":"https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-404759.html","cnSolution":"厂商已发布升级版本修复漏洞，请广大用户及时下载更新至V13.5及以上版本：https://support.industry.siemens.com/cs/ww/en/view/109761843/","cnTitle":"Siemens Siveillance Video摄像机驱动程序信息泄露漏洞","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-01695","cveId":"CVE-2024-12569","hazardLevel":"中","id":30248,"pubDate":"2025-01-17"},{"cnDescribe":"D-Link DIR-816是中国友讯（D-Link）公司的一款无线路由器。D-Link DIR-816 A2 1.10CNB05_R1B011D88210版本存在访问控制错误漏洞，该漏洞源于/goform/form2AddVrtsrv.cgi存在访问控制不当。攻击者可利用该漏洞可以设置设备的虚拟服务。","cnImpact":"D-Link DIR-816 A2 1.10CNB05_R1B011D882